OL,3,GNEWSAResidents keep ashes at home due  
OL,4,Ato lack of graves                      
OL,6,FResidents in a Hampshire village have  
OL,7,Fsaid they are being forced to keep the 
OL,8,Fashes of their loved ones at home      
OL,9,Fbecause they have nowhere to bury them 
OL,10,Fnearby.                                
OL,12,FPeople in South Wonston said their     
OL,13,F20-year campaign for a burial ground   
OL,14,Fhad been blocked by the Ministry of    
OL,15,FDefence (MoD).                         
OL,17,FCampaigners, including members of the  
OL,18,Fparish council, said they had          
OL,19,Fidentified a suitable piece of land,   
OL,20,Fbut were being refused permission to   
OL,21,Fuse it.                                
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
