OL,3,GNEWSAResidents keep ashes at home due  
OL,4,Ato lack of graves                      
OL,6,FAn MoD spokesperson said the site was  
OL,7,F"not being considered for disposal and 
OL,8,Fremains subject to a continuing defence
OL,9,Frequirement".                          
